      "num_turns": 36,
      "result": "Implemented the Rails 8.0.2 URL shortener API with PostgreSQL persistence, unique generated/custom codes, click tracking, validation, and redirects. `sh start.sh` applies migrations and serves on `0.0.0.0:8000`; the README explains how to run it.\n\nVerified the endpoints over HTTP, including malformed input, duplicate codes, redirect location and click count, the `app` host, and data surviving a server restart. `bundle exec rails test` passes, but the starter contains no test cases. I also pinned JSON below version 3 because the newer JSON gem was incompatible with Rails 8.0.2. Test records were removed afterward; the database is empty.",
